    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d46">

                <pb facs="0105" n="31" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg31"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/3965</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-20T13:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 20, 1917, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 2.40 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>926. Prime Minister and Minister for Foreign Affairs left Rome unexpectedly night
                    before last, incognito. Just learned they have gone France, believed for
                    conference touching Russia, where situation considered extremely grave, and for
                    greater Italian interests in eastern Mediterranean.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
